$ Simplified BAH Wing - SOL 146 Validation (HA146E)
$ Cantilever beam model with lumped masses
$ Impulsive force at wing tip (GRID 6)
$ Units: inches, pounds-force, seconds
$ Mass unit: slinch = lb*s^2/in (= slug/12)
$
$ Target: f1 (1st bending) ~ 2-5 Hz
$ EI = E*I1 = 1.044e7 * 5000 = 5.22e10 lb-in^2
$ Total mass ~ 10.35 slinch (= 4000 lb / 386.4 in/s^2)
$
NASTRAN SYSTEM(1)=0
ID BAH_WING,HA146E
SOL 146
CEND
$
TITLE = SIMPLIFIED BAH WING - SOL 146 TRANSIENT RESPONSE
SPC = 1
$
BEGIN BULK
$
$ ================================================================
$ GRID POINTS - Along elastic axis of BAH wing
$ Swept-back wing with elastic axis positions
$ Y = span station (inches): 0, 90, 186, 268, 368, 458
$ ================================================================
GRID,1,,0.0,0.0,0.0,,123456
GRID,2,,20.25,90.0,0.0
GRID,3,,17.85,186.0,0.0
GRID,4,,15.8,268.0,0.0
GRID,5,,13.1,368.0,0.0
GRID,6,,11.05,458.0,0.0
$
$ ================================================================
$ CBAR ELEMENTS - Beam elements along span
$ V-vector = (0,0,1) for z-up orientation
$ ================================================================
CBAR,1,1,1,2,0.0,0.0,1.0
CBAR,2,1,2,3,0.0,0.0,1.0
CBAR,3,1,3,4,0.0,0.0,1.0
CBAR,4,1,4,5,0.0,0.0,1.0
CBAR,5,1,5,6,0.0,0.0,1.0
$
$ ================================================================
$ PROPERTY - PBAR with BAH wing representative stiffness
$ A=10 in^2, I1=5000 in^4 (flapwise bending), I2=500 in^4, J=2500 in^4
$ EI = 1.044e7 * 5000 = 5.22e10 lb-in^2
$ GJ = 4.015e6 * 2500 = 1.00e10 lb-in^2
$ ================================================================
PBAR,1,1,10.0,5000.0,500.0,2500.0
$
$ ================================================================
$ MATERIAL - MAT1 aluminum
$ E = 1.044e7 psi, G = 4.015e6 psi, NU = 0.3
$ RHO = 2.59e-4 slinch/in^3 (aluminum density for consistent mass)
$ ================================================================
MAT1,1,1.044e7,,0.3,2.59e-4
$
$ ================================================================
$ CONCENTRATED MASSES (CONM2) - Distributed along span
$ Total wing weight ~ 4000 lb -> mass = 4000/386.4 = 10.35 slinch
$ With rotational inertia for positive definite mass matrix
$ CONM2: EID,GID,CID,MASS,X1,X2,X3,,I11,I21,I22,I31,I32,I33
$ ================================================================
CONM2,101,2,,3.50,0.0,0.0,0.0,,500.0,0.0,500.0,0.0,0.0,500.0
CONM2,102,3,,2.80,0.0,0.0,0.0,,400.0,0.0,400.0,0.0,0.0,400.0
CONM2,103,4,,2.00,0.0,0.0,0.0,,300.0,0.0,300.0,0.0,0.0,300.0
CONM2,104,5,,1.25,0.0,0.0,0.0,,200.0,0.0,200.0,0.0,0.0,200.0
CONM2,105,6,,0.80,0.0,0.0,0.0,,150.0,0.0,150.0,0.0,0.0,150.0
$
$ ================================================================
$ CONSTRAINTS - Root fully clamped
$ ================================================================
SPC1,1,123456,1
$
ENDDATA
